        "cooked": "<p>Clearly they’re just flush with cash now.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/sellout-sode\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/sellout-sode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/2195fb0b2700b1df502aa120a68af896730a6609.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/sellout-sode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Sellout-Sode</a></h3>\n\n  <p>What's all this then? This mini-episode is in reaction to . Will this change who we are as people? One can hope! Happy holidays, everyone! This last year was momentous for a lot of reasons, but we had a great time making Letters Page episodes for all...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
